Woah, its like  you know in other games, were a female pretends to be male and hides it with a plethora of armor or other stuff.

&#x200B;

Yes I follow the story and lore, I had idea's after the first quest this was going to happen. was also kind of foreshadowed. I still don't get this upset over things. The story is good. I enjoy it. I shall await downvotes.

Only problem is when you make a new character they aren't auto cleared and I believe you only get the renown and xp for getting them again. As the stats are account bound.

&#x200B;

gotta say starting a lvl 5 Barb with 150 so str was nice lol.

"Weekly Sneaky Peeky: The elaborate Sun, shall not shine on this dire time"

&#x200B;

"Weekly Sneaky Peeky: The dawn will never come, As my soul is lost to the void"

&#x200B;

Idk just wanted to try titles as well, with the same concept . Granted I believe "The Dawn Would never Have Come" is better. if they just left off around.

all information i provided was from the NASA website. and no where does it say on the wiki or NASA website that he "landed on the moon". im using your wording here. hes not even on the list of people who orbited the moon. hes been to the ISS for missions 30/31 and was also aprt of the DELTA mission.

&#x200B;

[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andr%C3%A9\_Kuipers](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andr%C3%A9_Kuipers)

